14. authorize_transport_leg_loading TLA OA RTPA (requires transport_leg_assembled TLA, origin_availability_locked OA, candidate_task_profile_linked OA RTPA, not transport_leg_loading_authorized TLA). We have all: TLA assembled, OA locked, OA task profile linked (we re-attached at step12), not authorized yet. Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized TLA.

Now we need to dispatch SCA: execute_schedule_dispatch SCA VUG DSA.

Preconditions: dispatch_allocated SCA (true), candidate_vehicle_linked SCA VUG (true), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked SCA DSA (true), not dispatched SCA (currently false). So we can do.

Now we need to release compliance certificate: release_compliance_certificate SCA CCA.

Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked SCA CCA (true). Effect: compliance_certificate_available CCA, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked SCA CCA.

